<Base title="Privacy — Kurian Benny" description="How contact enquiries and website analytics are handled on Kurian Benny’s website."><section class="wrap section article"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY / ENQUIRIES & ANALYTICS</p><h1>Your enquiry.<br /><em>Handled thoughtfully.</em></h1><div class="prose"><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The embedded Google Form collects the information you choose to provide so I can understand and respond to your enquiry. Please include only information relevant to your project.</p><h2>Contact form processing</h2><p>The contact page embeds Google Forms. Loading the form connects your browser to Google, and submitted responses are processed and stored through Google Forms for me to review. Google’s processing is governed by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p><h2>Other contact channels</h2><p>Opening WhatsApp, GitHub, or LinkedIn takes you to those services, which apply their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Website hosting</h2><p>This is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. It has no visitor accounts. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, and your browser may connect to Google to display them.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>This website uses Microsoft Clarity on its public GitHub Pages domain to understand how visitors navigate pages, using heatmaps and session recordings. Clarity processes browsing interactions and device information and may use cookies depending on consent and project settings. The Google Form is embedded in a third-party iframe whose contents are not captured by Clarity; its surrounding panel is also explicitly masked. Microsoft’s processing is described in the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>You can reach me through the contact channels listed on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></div></section></Base>
